    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      49.34,
      552.59,
      287.93,
      637.55
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land/servitude to be acquired : Following allotment of land depicted in Cadastral Plan bearing No. 820170 situated in the Village of Jamburegoda West in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Welipitiya in the District of Matara is required to acquire for building Jamburegoda West Sewa Piyasa :",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold",
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.960000038146973
