      467.87,
      543.05,
      584.73
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid Land/servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at Divisional Secretariat of Welipitiya on 27.02.2026 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify me in writing (in duplicate) on or before 13.02.2026, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
